Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.75,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Faltam três dias.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.77,0:00:05.31,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Na quinta-feira, 19 de novembro, GTA 6 chega
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.33,0:00:08.12,Legenda,,0,0,0,,ao PlayStation 5 e ao Xbox Series.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.14,0:00:11.56,Legenda,,0,0,0,,E o lugar onde você vai passar as próximas
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.58,0:00:15.15,Legenda,,0,0,0,,centenas de horas não foi inventado do zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.17,0:00:16.56,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Leonida é a Flórida.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.58,0:00:18.60,Legenda,,0,0,0,,E dá para provar, pedaço por pedaço.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.15,0:00:01.67,Etiqueta,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,150)}GTA 6 · TRAILER
Dialogue: 1,0:00:01.92,0:00:08.04,Etiqueta,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,150)}GTA 6 · OFICIAL
Dialogue: 1,0:00:08.29,0:00:15.07,Etiqueta,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,150)}GTA 6 · TRAILER
Dialogue: 1,0:00:15.32,0:00:16.48,Etiqueta,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,150)}MAPA
Dialogue: 1,0:00:16.73,0:00:18.87,EtiquetaReal,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,150)}VIDA REAL
Dialogue: 2,0:00:01.92,0:00:05.52,Grande,,0,0,0,,{\an1\fs150\fad(100,250)\move(-30,860,110,860,0,260)\1c&H00428CFF\shad6\4c&H40240612}19 DE NOVEMBRO
Dialogue: 2,0:00:02.12,0:00:05.52,Apoio,,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(118,878)\fad(150,250)}PS5 e Xbox Series X|S
Dialogue: 2,0:00:15.32,0:00:17.92,Grande,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,470)\fs170\fad(120,250)\fscx60\fscy60\t(0,220,\fscx100\fscy100)\1c&H008B3DFF\shad6\4c&H40240612}LEONIDA = FLÓRIDA
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.97,0:00:20.66,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Aqui é a Pixelzada.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.68,0:00:23.70,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Neste vídeo a gente atravessa o mapa de GTA 6
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.72,0:00:26.49,Legenda,,0,0,0,,de ponta a ponta: a cidade, as praias, as
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.51,0:00:29.08,Legenda,,0,0,0,,ilhas, o pântano e até a tal montanha.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.10,0:00:31.97,Legenda,,0,0,0,,E em cada parada eu te mostro o que a Rockstar
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.99,0:00:33.32,Legenda,,0,0,0,,copiou da vida real.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.34,0:00:35.89,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Se você vai jogar no lançamento, já se
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.91,0:00:38.58,Legenda,,0,0,0,,inscreve, porque essa semana o canal vai
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.60,0:00:39.21,Legenda,,0,0,0,,ferver.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:19.12,0:00:20.58,Etiqueta,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,150)}GTA 6 · OFICIAL
Dialogue: 1,0:00:20.83,0:00:26.91,Etiqueta,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,150)}GTA 6 · TRAILER
Dialogue: 1,0:00:27.16,0:00:33.24,Etiqueta,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,150)}GTA 6 · OFICIAL
Dialogue: 1,0:00:18.97,0:00:39.58,Capitulo,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}ABERTURA
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.58,0:00:41.78,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Primeiro, um pouco de história.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.80,0:00:44.58,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Vice City não é novidade na série.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.60,0:00:47.83,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Ela apareceu em 2002, em GTA Vice City, presa
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.85,0:00:50.88,Legenda,,0,0,0,,nos anos oitenta, com terno pastel, neon e
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.90,0:00:52.63,Legenda,,0,0,0,,trilha de sintetizador.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.65,0:00:55.07,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Era a Miami dos filmes de crime.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.09,0:00:58.41,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Mais de vinte anos depois, a cidade volta.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.43,0:01:01.62,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Só que agora nos dias de hoje, com celular na
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.64,0:01:04.76,Legenda,,0,0,0,,mão, rede social e todo mundo filmando tudo.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:39.73,0:00:44.50,EtiquetaReal,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,150)}VIDA REAL
Dialogue: 1,0:00:52.80,0:00:54.99,Etiqueta,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,150)}GTA 6 · OFICIAL
Dialogue: 1,0:00:55.24,0:00:58.33,Etiqueta,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,150)}GTA 6 · OFICIAL
Dialogue: 1,0:00:58.58,0:01:05.03,Etiqueta,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,150)}GTA 6 · OFICIAL
Dialogue: 1,0:00:39.58,0:01:05.13,Capitulo,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}VICE CITY ESTÁ DE VOLTA
Dialogue: 2,0:00:55.24,0:00:58.84,Grande,,0,0,0,,{\an1\fs120\fad(100,250)\move(-30,860,110,860,0,260)\1c&H008B3DFF\shad6\4c&H40240612}MAIS DE 20 ANOS DEPOIS
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.13,0:01:08.21,Legenda,,0,0,0,,E desta vez a Rockstar não fez só uma cidade.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.23,0:01:11.54,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Ela fez um estado inteiro, chamado Leonida.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.56,0:01:14.33,Legenda,,0,0,0,,A inspiração é óbvia: a Flórida, o terceiro
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.35,0:01:17.17,Legenda,,0,0,0,,estado mais populoso dos Estados Unidos, com
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.19,0:01:19.77,Legenda,,0,0,0,,mais de vinte e três milhões de pessoas.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.79,0:01:22.44,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Em GTA 5, a gente tinha Los Santos e o
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.46,0:01:23.81,Legenda,,0,0,0,,interior em volta.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.83,0:01:26.95,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Em GTA 6, a promessa é um estado com várias
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.97,0:01:29.95,Legenda,,0,0,0,,regiões, cada uma com cara, clima e gente
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.97,0:01:30.84,Legenda,,0,0,0,,diferente.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:05.28,0:01:08.13,Etiqueta,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,150)}GTA 6 · OFICIAL
Dialogue: 1,0:01:08.38,0:01:11.46,Etiqueta,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,150)}MAPA
