Dialogue: 1,0:01:05.13,0:01:31.21,Capitulo,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}UM ESTADO INTEIRO: LEONIDA
Dialogue: 2,0:01:08.38,0:01:11.98,Grande,,0,0,0,,{\an1\fs150\fad(100,250)\move(-30,860,110,860,0,260)\1c&H008B3DFF\shad6\4c&H40240612}LEONIDA
Dialogue: 2,0:01:08.58,0:01:11.98,Apoio,,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(118,878)\fad(150,250)}o estado de GTA 6
Dialogue: 2,0:01:13.06,0:01:16.66,Grande,,0,0,0,,{\an1\fs150\fad(100,250)\move(-30,860,110,860,0,260)\1c&H00428CFF\shad6\4c&H40240612}23 MILHÕES
Dialogue: 2,0:01:13.26,0:01:16.66,Apoio,,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(118,878)\fad(150,250)}habitantes na Flórida real
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.21,0:01:34.50,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Até agora, a Rockstar mostrou seis regiões.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.52,0:01:37.23,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Vice City, a capital do neon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.25,0:01:40.79,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Leonida Keys, o colar de ilhas no sul.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.81,0:01:41.92,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Grassrivers, o pântano.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.94,0:01:44.72,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Port Gellhorn, na costa do Golfo.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.74,0:01:47.00,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Ambrosia, no interior.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.02,0:01:50.42,Legenda,,0,0,0,,E o Mount Kalaga, um parque nacional no norte.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.44,0:01:52.62,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Vamos uma por uma.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:31.36,0:01:34.42,Etiqueta,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,150)}MAPA
Dialogue: 1,0:01:34.67,0:01:37.15,Etiqueta,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,150)}MAPA
