Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.99,0:01:55.68,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Vice City é Miami, sem disfarce.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.70,0:01:58.63,Legenda,,0,0,0,,E o melhor exemplo é Vice Beach, a versão do
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.65,0:02:00.20,Legenda,,0,0,0,,jogo para Miami Beach.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.22,0:02:02.85,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Na vida real, o distrito histórico de Miami
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.87,0:02:05.31,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Beach tem cerca de oitocentos prédios em
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.33,0:02:07.38,Legenda,,0,0,0,,estilo art déco, aquelas fachadas
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.40,0:02:09.96,Legenda,,0,0,0,,arredondadas, pintadas em tons pastel, com
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.98,0:02:11.11,Legenda,,0,0,0,,letreiro de neon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.13,0:02:14.02,Legenda,,0,0,0,,E é exatamente isso que aparece nos trailers:
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.04,0:02:16.86,Legenda,,0,0,0,,hotéis iluminados, carro esportivo parado na
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.88,0:02:19.71,Legenda,,0,0,0,,avenida e gente na calçada até de madrugada.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:53.14,0:01:55.60,Etiqueta,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,150)}GTA 6 · OFICIAL
Dialogue: 1,0:01:55.85,0:02:00.12,Etiqueta,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,150)}GTA 6 · TRAILER
