Dialogue: 2,0:02:02.22,0:02:05.62,Apoio,,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(118,878)\fad(150,250)}art déco em Miami Beach
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.08,0:02:21.21,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Tem mais.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.23,0:02:24.23,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Miami é conhecida como a capital mundial dos
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.25,0:02:27.36,Legenda,,0,0,0,,cruzeiros, e Vice City tem porto, iate, lancha
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.38,0:02:29.16,Legenda,,0,0,0,,e jet ski para todo lado.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.18,0:02:31.90,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Os prédios espelhados do centro, as pontes
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.92,0:02:34.76,Legenda,,0,0,0,,ligando a cidade à praia, as festas na beira
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.78,0:02:35.37,Legenda,,0,0,0,,do mar.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.39,0:02:38.27,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Quem já viu Miami de perto vai reconhecer a
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.29,0:02:39.66,Legenda,,0,0,0,,cidade em segundos.
