Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.03,0:02:43.31,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Descendo para o sul, chegamos em Leonida Keys.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.33,0:02:46.00,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Na vida real, as Florida Keys são uma corrente
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.02,0:02:48.69,Legenda,,0,0,0,,de ilhas ligadas por uma única estrada sobre o
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.71,0:02:51.27,Legenda,,0,0,0,,mar, a Overseas Highway, com quarenta e duas
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.29,0:02:51.82,Legenda,,0,0,0,,pontes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.84,0:02:54.75,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Uma delas tem quase onze quilômetros.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.77,0:02:57.60,Legenda,,0,0,0,,É água azul-turquesa dos dois lados, barco de
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.62,0:03:00.40,Legenda,,0,0,0,,pesca, bar de praia e muita gente fugindo da
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.42,0:03:00.99,Legenda,,0,0,0,,cidade.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.01,0:03:04.03,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Nos trailers, essa vibe aparece em festa em
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.05,0:03:06.87,Legenda,,0,0,0,,barco, passeio de lancha e areia branca.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:40.18,0:02:43.23,Etiqueta,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,150)}MAPA
Dialogue: 1,0:02:43.48,0:02:51.74,EtiquetaReal,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,150)}VIDA REAL
