Dialogue: 2,0:02:52.19,0:02:55.59,Apoio,,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(118,878)\fad(150,250)}Seven Mile Bridge
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.24,0:03:10.07,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Agora sobe um pouco, para o meio do mapa.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.09,0:03:13.07,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Grassrivers é o Everglades, o maior pântano
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.09,0:03:15.09,Legenda,,0,0,0,,tropical dos Estados Unidos.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.11,0:03:17.91,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Na vida real, é um mar de capim e água rasa,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.93,0:03:20.78,Legenda,,0,0,0,,cortado por aqueles barcos com hélice gigante
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.80,0:03:21.68,Legenda,,0,0,0,,na traseira.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.70,0:03:24.63,Legenda,,0,0,0,,E, claro, cheio de jacaré.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.65,0:03:27.20,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Os trailers de GTA 6 não esconderam: tem
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.22,0:03:30.07,Legenda,,0,0,0,,jacaré no pântano, na estrada e até dentro de
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.09,0:03:31.51,Legenda,,0,0,0,,loja de conveniência.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.53,0:03:34.57,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Sim, isso é uma referência a vídeos reais que
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.59,0:03:36.24,Legenda,,0,0,0,,viralizaram na Flórida.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:07.39,0:03:09.99,Etiqueta,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,150)}MAPA
Dialogue: 1,0:03:10.24,0:03:15.01,EtiquetaReal,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,150)}VIDA REAL
Dialogue: 1,0:03:15.26,0:03:21.60,EtiquetaReal,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,150)}VIDA REAL
Dialogue: 1,0:03:21.85,0:03:24.55,EtiquetaReal,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,150)}VIDA REAL
Dialogue: 1,0:03:24.80,0:03:31.43,Etiqueta,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,150)}GTA 6 · OFICIAL
Dialogue: 1,0:03:31.68,0:03:36.51,Etiqueta,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,150)}GTA 6 · OFICIAL
Dialogue: 1,0:03:07.24,0:03:36.61,Capitulo,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}GRASSRIVERS = EVERGLADES
Dialogue: 2,0:03:10.24,0:03:13.84,Grande,,0,0,0,,{\an1\fs150\fad(100,250)\move(-30,860,110,860,0,260)\1c&H008B3DFF\shad6\4c&H40240612}GRASSRIVERS
Dialogue: 2,0:03:10.44,0:03:13.84,Apoio,,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(118,878)\fad(150,250)}Everglades na vida real
Dialogue: 2,0:03:21.85,0:03:23.65,Grande,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,470)\fs190\fad(120,250)\fscx60\fscy60\t(0,220,\fscx100\fscy100)\1c&H001AFFC6\shad6\4c&H40240612}JACARÉ!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.61,0:03:39.63,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Do outro lado do estado, na costa do Golfo,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.65,0:03:41.09,Legenda,,0,0,0,,fica Port Gellhorn.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.11,0:03:44.10,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Se Vice City é o cartão-postal, Port Gellhorn
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.12,0:03:46.17,Legenda,,0,0,0,,é a praia que ficou para trás.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.19,0:03:49.00,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Cidade portuária, motel de beira de estrada,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.02,0:03:51.96,Legenda,,0,0,0,,casa noturna com letreiro piscando e bem menos
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.98,0:03:52.62,Legenda,,0,0,0,,glamour.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.64,0:03:55.27,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Tudo indica que a inspiração vem do norte da
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.29,0:03:57.81,Legenda,,0,0,0,,costa do Golfo da Flórida, a região que os
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.83,0:03:59.72,Legenda,,0,0,0,,americanos chamam de Panhandle.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:36.76,0:03:41.01,Etiqueta,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,150)}MAPA
Dialogue: 1,0:03:41.26,0:03:46.09,EtiquetaReal,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,150)}VIDA REAL
Dialogue: 1,0:03:46.34,0:03:52.54,EtiquetaReal,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,150)}VIDA REAL
Dialogue: 1,0:03:52.79,0:03:59.99,Etiqueta,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,150)}GTA 6 · OFICIAL
Dialogue: 1,0:03:36.61,0:04:00.09,Capitulo,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}PORT GELLHORN = GOLFO
Dialogue: 2,0:03:36.76,0:03:40.36,Grande,,0,0,0,,{\an1\fs150\fad(100,250)\move(-30,860,110,860,0,260)\1c&H008B3DFF\shad6\4c&H40240612}PORT GELLHORN
Dialogue: 2,0:03:36.96,0:03:40.36,Apoio,,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(118,878)\fad(150,250)}costa do Golfo
Dialogue: 2,0:03:54.64,0:03:58.24,Grande,,0,0,0,,{\an1\fs150\fad(100,250)\move(-30,860,110,860,0,260)\1c&H00D6E62E\shad6\4c&H40240612}PANHANDLE
Dialogue: 2,0:03:54.84,0:03:58.24,Apoio,,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(118,878)\fad(150,250)}norte da costa do Golfo
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.09,0:04:02.09,Legenda,,0,0,0,,No interior fica Ambrosia.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.11,0:04:05.35,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Aqui o clima muda de vez: menos praia e mais
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.37,0:04:06.80,Legenda,,0,0,0,,fumaça de fábrica.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.82,0:04:09.53,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Ambrosia gira em torno de uma refinaria de
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.55,0:04:12.00,Legenda,,0,0,0,,açúcar, e isso também tem origem real.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.02,0:04:14.46,Legenda,,0,0,0,,No interior da Flórida existe uma cidade,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.48,0:04:17.19,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Clewiston, que se apresenta como a cidade mais
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.21,0:04:19.87,Legenda,,0,0,0,,doce dos Estados Unidos, justamente por causa
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.89,0:04:21.93,Legenda,,0,0,0,,das plantações de cana e da usina.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.95,0:04:25.41,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Estrada reta, caminhonete, plantação a perder
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.43,0:04:27.22,Legenda,,0,0,0,,de vista e muita lama.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:00.24,0:04:02.01,Etiqueta,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,150)}MAPA
Dialogue: 1,0:04:02.26,0:04:11.92,EtiquetaReal,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,150)}VIDA REAL
Dialogue: 1,0:04:12.17,0:04:16.89,EtiquetaReal,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,150)}VIDA REAL
Dialogue: 1,0:04:22.10,0:04:27.49,Etiqueta,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,150)}GTA 6 · OFICIAL
Dialogue: 1,0:04:00.09,0:04:27.59,Capitulo,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}AMBROSIA = INTERIOR
Dialogue: 2,0:04:00.24,0:04:03.84,Grande,,0,0,0,,{\an1\fs150\fad(100,250)\move(-30,860,110,860,0,260)\1c&H008B3DFF\shad6\4c&H40240612}AMBROSIA
Dialogue: 2,0:04:00.44,0:04:03.84,Apoio,,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(118,878)\fad(150,250)}o interior industrial
Dialogue: 2,0:04:13.02,0:04:16.62,Grande,,0,0,0,,{\an1\fs150\fad(100,250)\move(-30,860,110,860,0,260)\1c&H00428CFF\shad6\4c&H40240612}CLEWISTON
Dialogue: 2,0:04:13.22,0:04:16.62,Apoio,,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(118,878)\fad(150,250)}"a cidade mais doce dos EUA"
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.59,0:04:30.49,Legenda,,0,0,0,,E a última região é o Mount Kalaga, um parque
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.51,0:04:33.48,Legenda,,0,0,0,,nacional com trilhas, rios, mata fechada, caça
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.50,0:04:34.76,Legenda,,0,0,0,,e fora de estrada.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.78,0:04:37.70,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Aqui vai uma curiosidade: a Flórida de verdade
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.72,0:04:39.25,Legenda,,0,0,0,,quase não tem montanha.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.27,0:04:41.91,Legenda,,0,0,0,,O ponto mais alto do estado tem só cento e
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.93,0:04:43.45,Legenda,,0,0,0,,cinco metros de altura.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.47,0:04:46.31,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Ou seja, nessa parte a Rockstar tomou uma
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.33,0:04:47.74,Legenda,,0,0,0,,liberdade criativa.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.76,0:04:50.34,Legenda,,0,0,0,,O que tudo indica é que o parque mistura as
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.36,0:04:52.94,Legenda,,0,0,0,,florestas do norte da Flórida com relevo de
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.96,0:04:54.35,Legenda,,0,0,0,,outros estados do sul.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:27.74,0:04:31.08,Etiqueta,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,150)}MAPA
Dialogue: 1,0:04:31.33,0:04:34.68,Etiqueta,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,150)}GTA 6 · OFICIAL
Dialogue: 1,0:04:47.91,0:04:54.62,EtiquetaReal,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,150)}VIDA REAL
Dialogue: 1,0:04:27.59,0:04:54.72,Capitulo,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}MOUNT KALAGA
Dialogue: 2,0:04:27.74,0:04:31.34,Grande,,0,0,0,,{\an1\fs150\fad(100,250)\move(-30,860,110,860,0,260)\1c&H008B3DFF\shad6\4c&H40240612}MOUNT KALAGA
Dialogue: 2,0:04:27.94,0:04:31.34,Apoio,,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(118,878)\fad(150,250)}parque nacional
Dialogue: 2,0:04:39.42,0:04:43.02,Grande,,0,0,0,,{\an1\fs150\fad(100,250)\move(-30,860,110,860,0,260)\1c&H00428CFF\shad6\4c&H40240612}105 METROS
Dialogue: 2,0:04:39.62,0:04:43.02,Apoio,,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(118,878)\fad(150,250)}ponto mais alto da Flórida
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.72,0:04:57.36,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Agora, o detalhe que deixa Leonida tão
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.38,0:04:58.86,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Flórida: as pessoas.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.88,0:05:01.88,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Na internet existe até um meme, o famoso Homem
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.90,0:05:04.90,Legenda,,0,0,0,,da Flórida, para as manchetes mais absurdas do
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.92,0:05:05.52,Legenda,,0,0,0,,estado.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.54,0:05:07.84,Legenda,,0,0,0,,E a Rockstar abraçou isso.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.86,0:05:10.30,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Os trailers mostram vídeos de rede social
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.32,0:05:12.86,Legenda,,0,0,0,,dentro do jogo, com gente fazendo as coisas
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.88,0:05:15.15,Legenda,,0,0,0,,mais sem noção que você pode imaginar.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.17,0:05:18.38,Legenda,,0,0,0,,O próprio site oficial tem uma seção chamada
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.40,0:05:21.34,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Only in Leonida, ou seja, só em Leonida.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:54.87,0:04:58.78,Etiqueta,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,150)}GTA 6 · OFICIAL
Dialogue: 1,0:05:05.69,0:05:07.76,Etiqueta,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,150)}GTA 6 · OFICIAL
Dialogue: 1,0:05:08.01,0:05:15.07,Etiqueta,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,150)}GTA 6 · OFICIAL
Dialogue: 1,0:05:15.32,0:05:21.61,Etiqueta,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,150)}GTA 6 · OFICIAL
Dialogue: 1,0:04:54.72,0:05:21.71,Capitulo,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}SÓ EM LEONIDA
Dialogue: 2,0:05:15.32,0:05:18.92,Grande,,0,0,0,,{\an1\fs150\fad(100,250)\move(-30,860,110,860,0,260)\1c&H008B3DFF\shad6\4c&H40240612}ONLY IN LEONIDA
Dialogue: 2,0:05:15.52,0:05:18.92,Apoio,,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(118,878)\fad(150,250)}só em Leonida
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.71,0:05:24.28,Legenda,,0,0,0,,E Leonida sem carro não seria GTA.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.30,0:05:26.95,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Pelo material oficial, já dá para ver um
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.97,0:05:28.25,Legenda,,0,0,0,,pedaço da garagem.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.27,0:05:31.34,Legenda,,0,0,0,,O Grotti Cheetah, superesportivo clássico da
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.36,0:05:32.91,Legenda,,0,0,0,,série, está de volta.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.93,0:05:35.87,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Tem o Vapid Stanier, o sedã que todo mundo
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.89,0:05:37.98,Legenda,,0,0,0,,conhece de viatura e de táxi.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.00,0:05:40.47,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Tem buggy para a areia, lancha para o mar e
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.49,0:05:42.86,Legenda,,0,0,0,,muscle car para fazer barulho na avenida.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.88,0:05:45.64,Legenda,,0,0,0,,E isso combina com a Flórida real, um estado
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.66,0:05:48.49,Legenda,,0,0,0,,onde quase tudo depende de carro e onde barco
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.51,0:05:51.16,Legenda,,0,0,0,,na garagem é quase tão comum quanto carro.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:21.86,0:05:28.17,Etiqueta,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,150)}GTA 6 · OFICIAL
Dialogue: 1,0:05:28.42,0:05:32.83,Etiqueta,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,150)}GTA 6 · OFICIAL
Dialogue: 1,0:05:33.08,0:05:37.90,Etiqueta,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,150)}GTA 6 · OFICIAL
Dialogue: 1,0:05:38.15,0:05:39.53,Etiqueta,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,150)}GTA 6 · OFICIAL
Dialogue: 1,0:05:39.78,0:05:41.15,Etiqueta,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,150)}GTA 6 · OFICIAL
Dialogue: 1,0:05:41.40,0:05:42.78,Etiqueta,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,150)}GTA 6 · OFICIAL
Dialogue: 1,0:05:43.03,0:05:51.43,Etiqueta,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,150)}GTA 6 · OFICIAL
Dialogue: 1,0:05:21.71,0:05:51.53,Capitulo,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}OS CARROS
Dialogue: 2,0:05:28.42,0:05:32.02,Grande,,0,0,0,,{\an1\fs150\fad(100,250)\move(-30,860,110,860,0,260)\1c&H00428CFF\shad6\4c&H40240612}GROTTI CHEETAH
Dialogue: 2,0:05:28.62,0:05:32.02,Apoio,,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(118,878)\fad(150,250)}superesportivo clássico
Dialogue: 2,0:05:33.08,0:05:36.68,Grande,,0,0,0,,{\an1\fs150\fad(100,250)\move(-30,860,110,860,0,260)\1c&H00D6E62E\shad6\4c&H40240612}VAPID STANIER
Dialogue: 2,0:05:33.28,0:05:36.68,Apoio,,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(118,878)\fad(150,250)}viatura e táxi
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.53,0:05:54.36,Legenda,,0,0,0,,E no meio de tudo isso estão Jason e Lucia.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.38,0:05:56.90,Legenda,,0,0,0,,A Rockstar resume a história assim: um golpe
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.92,0:05:59.54,Legenda,,0,0,0,,fácil dá errado, e os dois acabam no lado mais
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.56,0:06:02.08,Legenda,,0,0,0,,sombrio do lugar mais ensolarado da América,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.10,0:06:04.23,Legenda,,0,0,0,,presos numa conspiração criminosa que
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.25,0:06:06.01,Legenda,,0,0,0,,atravessa o estado de Leonida.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.03,0:06:08.52,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Lucia é a primeira protagonista mulher da
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.54,0:06:11.25,Legenda,,0,0,0,,série principal na era moderna, e a dupla vai
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.27,0:06:13.93,Legenda,,0,0,0,,ter que depender um do outro para sair viva.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:51.68,0:05:54.28,Etiqueta,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,150)}GTA 6 · OFICIAL
Dialogue: 1,0:05:54.53,0:06:00.11,Etiqueta,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,150)}GTA 6 · TRAILER
Dialogue: 1,0:06:00.36,0:06:05.93,Etiqueta,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,150)}GTA 6 · OFICIAL
Dialogue: 1,0:06:06.18,0:06:10.07,Etiqueta,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,150)}GTA 6 · OFICIAL
Dialogue: 1,0:06:10.32,0:06:14.20,Etiqueta,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,150)}GTA 6 · OFICIAL
Dialogue: 1,0:05:51.53,0:06:14.30,Capitulo,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}JASON E LUCIA
Dialogue: 2,0:05:51.68,0:05:55.28,Grande,,0,0,0,,{\an1\fs150\fad(100,250)\move(-30,860,110,860,0,260)\1c&H008B3DFF\shad6\4c&H40240612}JASON E LUCIA
Dialogue: 2,0:05:51.88,0:05:55.28,Apoio,,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(118,878)\fad(150,250)}os protagonistas
Dialogue: 2,0:05:57.38,0:06:01.58,Grande,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,470)\fs88\fad(120,250)\fscx60\fscy60\t(0,220,\fscx100\fscy100)\1c&H00428CFF\shad6\4c&H40240612}"O LADO MAIS SOMBRIO DO LUGAR MAIS ENSOLARADO"
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.30,0:06:17.27,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Agora, o que a Rockstar ainda não confirmou.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.29,0:06:19.89,Legenda,,0,0,0,,O tamanho exato do mapa, quantos quilômetros
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.91,0:06:22.23,Legenda,,0,0,0,,ele tem e se dá para entrar em todos os
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.25,0:06:22.85,Legenda,,0,0,0,,prédios.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.87,0:06:26.07,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Tem muita estimativa rodando na internet, mas
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.09,0:06:28.82,Legenda,,0,0,0,,número oficial, até agora, não existe.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.84,0:06:31.38,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Então desconfie de quem cravar.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.40,0:06:34.27,Legenda,,0,0,0,,A gente só vai saber de verdade quando o jogo
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.29,0:06:35.35,Legenda,,0,0,0,,estiver na mão.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:17.44,0:06:22.77,Etiqueta,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,150)}MAPA
Dialogue: 1,0:06:23.02,0:06:28.74,Etiqueta,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,150)}GTA 6 · TRAILER
Dialogue: 1,0:06:28.99,0:06:35.62,Etiqueta,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,150)}GTA 6 · OFICIAL
Dialogue: 1,0:06:14.30,0:06:35.72,Capitulo,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}O QUE AINDA NÃO FOI CONFIRMADO
Dialogue: 2,0:06:23.02,0:06:26.62,Grande,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,470)\fs200\fad(120,250)\fscx60\fscy60\t(0,220,\fscx100\fscy100)\1c&H001AFFC6\shad6\4c&H40240612}???
Dialogue: 2,0:06:23.27,0:06:26.62,Apoio,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,630)\fad(150,250)}tamanho oficial do mapa
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.72,0:06:37.63,Legenda,,0,0,0,,E isso está muito perto.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.65,0:06:40.24,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Na quarta-feira, a partir das oito da manhã no
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.26,0:06:42.42,Legenda,,0,0,0,,horário de Brasília, quem joga na Nova
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.44,0:06:44.82,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Zelândia já vai estar andando por Leonida.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.84,0:06:47.36,Legenda,,0,0,0,,E a Pixelzada vai trazer tudo aqui:
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.38,0:06:50.43,Legenda,,0,0,0,,curiosidades, segredos e os primeiros bugs.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.45,0:06:52.82,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Se inscreve no canal, ativa o sininho e
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.84,0:06:55.38,Legenda,,0,0,0,,comenta aqui embaixo: qual região você vai
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.40,0:06:56.52,Legenda,,0,0,0,,visitar primeiro?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.54,0:06:58.88,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Até o próximo vídeo.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:35.87,0:06:37.55,Etiqueta,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,150)}GTA 6 · OFICIAL
Dialogue: 1,0:06:37.80,0:06:44.74,Etiqueta,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,150)}GTA 6 · OFICIAL
